      "title": "India\u2019s Mazumdar-Shaw Is On A Mission to Save Lives",
      "summary": "Known as India\u2019s \u2018Queen of Biotech\u2019, Kiran Mazumdar-Shaw built Biocon from a rented garage almost 50 years ago. Today, her multibillion-dollar company is one of the world\u2019s biggest producers of insulin, and a leading force in biosimilars. \nAs she looks at handing over her life\u2019s work to successors, Mazumdar-Shaw talks to Bloomberg\u2019s Haslinda Amin about her pioneering journey as a female entrepreneur in India, her mission to deliver life-saving therapies to patients and what she believes India must do to tackle an AI future.  (Source: Bloomberg)",
